<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's C.Bank holds no auction for third week.</title>
<headline>Morocco's C.Bank holds no auction for third week.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) held no repurchase weekly auction for the third consecutive week because banks have enough liquidity, a bank official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The banks do not need money as was the case the two previous weeks,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The interbank interest rate is 5.5 percent while Bank al-Maghrib's rate is 6.5 percent, the official said.</p>
<p>-- Newsroom +212-7 72 65 18  REUTER WB</p>
